# Detection: JSCoinminer Symantec Detection Baseline
# Purpose: Surface Symantec Endpoint Protection detections of JSCoinminer attempts as a leading signal for adjacent compromise
# Source: IOCs.md, Symantec Detection Signatures
# Related Technique: T1189 - Drive-by Compromise

index=botsv3 sourcetype="symantec:ep:security:file"
("JSCoinminer" OR SID=30356 OR SID=30358)
| stats count by host, _time
| sort _time
